  "display_title": "To Catch a Falling Star",
  "description": "A thrilling fantasy that transcends time and space for two men and a nine-tailed fox! Sung-Woo is a third-generation billionaire. Upon opening a jewelry box his grandfather left him, he wakes up Bi, the nine-tailed fox sealed in a marble. Equally absurd? Bi comes from the ancient Joseon dynasty of Korea!? Sung-Woo finds it difficult to soothe the outraged Bi and calls his cousin Yoo-Sung to help. Although Yoo-Sung has never been greedy, he feels a strong possessiveness for the first time with Bi. Yoo-Sung takes Bi back to his home, kicking off a wonderful love triangle! \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
